tions or brutality."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blighted Deep </strong>is a minimalistic, linear <i>roguelite</i> in a dark, mysterious setting. Collect <i>Items</i> and <i>Shackles</i> that make you stronger and prepare yourself for the venture into the Deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing but his trusty magic wand, our hero will have to cleanse the deep of the terrible blight, which has spread and infected all kinds of creepy crawlies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >99+ unique items and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 steam achievements for perfectionists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tons of unique enemies, bosses and unlockable content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room is <i>randomly generated</i>, so no run is like the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shoot and dodge</i> your way through <i>mystical creatures</i> and encounter <i>strange NPCs</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Epic bossfights</i> will test your <i>skill and build</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blighted Deep </strong>features a retro aesthetic and rhythmic soundtrack for a unique, yet classic roguelite experience.</p>","developers":["Alexander Frey"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615850/853333f7b9db246dfddab6910efe9b33ceaa07d8/header.jpg?t=1756489001","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3615850/863598/3bd21f306b3b3448876b7f6